stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Validating: export requested
  Validating --> Preparing: valid
  Validating --> Failed: invalid
  Preparing --> Running: process spawned
  Preparing --> Failed: asset/process setup error
  Running --> Verifying: exit 0
  Running --> Cancelling: cancel
  Running --> Failed: non-zero
  Cancelling --> Cancelled: killed and cleaned
  Verifying --> Completed: verified and renamed
  Verifying --> Failed: invalid output
  Completed --> Idle
  Cancelled --> Idle
  Failed --> Idle
